                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> mvco:actedOver ; 
                               a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                              [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> mvco:resultsIn ; 
